# The Fractal Dimension of a Truth Language

Begin with one local rule: two positive answers may never be adjacent. The resulting binary universe is easy to enter but surprisingly rich to explore.

{{interactive_demo:0}}

The branching counts are Fibonacci numbers rather than powers of two. Use the exact recurrence implementation below, then compare it with complete enumeration.

{{algorithm:0}}

{{demo:1}}

## Sparse, yet exponentially alive

Although the number of survivors grows exponentially, their fraction among all binary strings falls exponentially.

{{visualization:1}}

<details><summary>Reveal the two-step contraction argument</summary>Writing $d_n=|W_n|/2^n$ and using $F_{n+4}=2F_{n+2}+F_{n+1}\le3F_{n+2}$ gives $d_{n+2}\le(3/4)d_n$. Iteration proves vanishing relative density.</details>

## Zooming toward dimension

At prefix depth $n$, cylinders have scale $2^{-n}$. Their count grows like $\varphi^n$, so the normalized dimension tends to $\log_2\varphi$.

{{interactive_demo:1}}

{{visualization:2}}

{{algorithm:2}}

<details><summary>Reveal the dimension derivation</summary>Binet's formula gives $F_{n+2}=C\varphi^n(1+o(1))$. Therefore $\log F_{n+2}/(n\log2)\to\log\varphi/\log2$. Since $1<\varphi<2$, the limit lies strictly between zero and one.</details>

## Build and test a stream

Every admissible finite prefix belongs to a complete infinite world: appending zeros forever supplies an extension. Try your own prefix.

{{interactive_demo:2}}

{{demo:0}}

## Beyond the golden-mean rule

Finite forbidden-block systems lead to finite adjacency matrices. Their spectral radii control growth and dimension. See the [symbolic dynamics overview](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symbolic_dynamics), [Fibonacci sequence](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fibonacci_sequence), and [box-counting dimension](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minkowski%E2%80%93Bouligand_dimension) for broader context.

{{algorithm:1}}

{{visualization:0}}

<details><summary>Expert note on scope and computability</summary>This regular language is decidable and its dimension is computable. Any theorem about semantic truth or a Chaitin-style halting probability requires an explicit formula coding, theory, ordering, and prefix-free machine; it does not follow from Fibonacci growth alone.</details>

{{demo:2}}

